{
  "_description": "Rollout simulation: cluster-a (an exclusive F5 appliance + a master) builds first, cluster-b (two workers) second. The simulator carries cluster-a's placements forward as pinned VMs, so cluster-b's workers are barred from the appliance's machine and the stock ledger advances between steps.",
